  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MC at Mondulkiri province will distribute and promote appropriate use of bite prevention tools to individuals within high-risk, forest exposed populations as part of their routine malaria outreach activities as part of the Bite Interruption Towards Elimination (BITE) project led by UCSF.  In Cambodia, HFO is the lead organisation on data collection, partner coordination, data analysis and reporting. [Cambodia]</narrative>
